public Integer next()
```

The `ThresholdIterator` class should take an `Iterator<Integer>` and an integer `threshold` as input. It should iterate over the elements in the input iterator and yield only the elements that are greater than the specified threshold.

Your task is to complete the implementation of the `hasNext` and `next` methods in the `ThresholdIterator` class to achieve the desired functionality.

Example:
```java
