```

Assume that the input lists may be empty, and the paths and names of the libraries and frameworks are valid.

### Solution:
```java
import java.util.List;

public class LinkerFlagsGenerator {
    public static String generateLinkerFlags(List<String> nativeLibraries, List<String> frameworks) {
        StringBuilder linkerFlags = new StringBuilder();

        for (String library : nativeLibraries) {
            String[] parts = library.split("/");
            String libraryName = parts[parts.length - 1].replaceFirst("lib", "").replace(".dylib", "");
            linkerFlags.append("-L").append(parts[0]).append("/").append(" -l").append(libraryName).append(" ");
